{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Tobari Quiet 是一款為 iPhone Safari 而設的深色模式延伸功能，能把沒有深色模式的網站與刺眼白頁轉成柔和深色，令夜間閱讀更舒適，並保留圖片原貌。它適合經常在 Safari 閱讀長文、於低光環境瀏覽網頁的用戶；現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-131.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>柔和深色與安靜檢視</h2>\n<p>啟用後，網頁以低調深色顯示，並可加上「安靜檢視」預設，進一步淡化圖片與文字，提供睡前、低調、私密及自訂選項；亦可按日落至日出或指定時段自動切換，並透過螢幕邊緣按鈕逐站開關。延伸功能不會傳送資料，設定只留在裝置，且可與阻擋廣告工具並用。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-125-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-126-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-127-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-128-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-129-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-130-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Tobari Quiet: Dark Mode Safari</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/tobari-quiet-dark-mode-safari/id6816496255?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.281588+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":332,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T06:03:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:34.933355+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:34.933355+00:00","content_hash":"8b279ee07af9a4c9ed577418d41db29b850d57c4c2aba0dfa4acca43c2ef5a09","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}